    "Localization.Strings.Pear Desktop Connector — Settings",
    "Localization.Strings.Connection settings apply to all Pear keys and dials.",
    "Localization.Strings.Whole percentages from 1 to 100. Default: 5%. Volume stays within 0–100%.",
    "Localization.Strings.Configure up to 16 playlists. Rotate to select; press to play. Selection is saved per dial.",
    "Localization.Strings.Names: 1–64 characters. Optional images: PNG or JPEG up to 24 KiB, stored with this action.",
    "Localization.Strings.Follow Shuffle State reads Pear's real shuffle state when pressed. Playlist playback requires a compatible Pear build with the native playlist API extension.",
    "Localization.Strings.Long lines are shortened to fit a key. Enable Show Title and clear a custom Stream Deck title to see metadata.",
    "Localization.Strings.Save extracts and stores the playlist ID. Follow uses Pear's actual shuffle state when pressed.",
    "Localization.Strings.Playlist playback requires a compatible Pear build with the native playlist API extension. Pear 3.12.0 cannot start playlists. A missing or unsupported native operation alerts; no fallback playback is sent.",
    "Localization.Strings.Clockwise increases volume or skips to the next track; counter-clockwise decreases volume or goes to the previous track. Volume press toggles mute; Transport press plays or pauses. Playlist Selector rotation changes the selected entry. A short touch refreshes the display; a hold does nothing. Clear custom host title/icon overrides to see Pear's display.",
    "Localization.Strings.Enable Pear's API Server. For local use, bind it to 127.0.0.1:26538. Approve the first request in Pear. A denied or revoked authorization needs Reauthorize.",
